    "en":  {
               "caution":  "The divergence between record KRW 83.33 trillion quarterly operating profit and a 63.7% stock drawdown shows the market is pricing in peak margins rather than past results. Investors should watch whether Samsung\u0027s rapid HBM4 ramp erodes SK hynix\u0027s pricing power as industry supply expands alongside higher 2027 CapEx. Meanwhile, U.S. export-license delays affecting Dalian and New York expansion plans, heavy KOSPI foreign selling, and ongoing U.S. DRAM antitrust litigation could keep overhead resistance near KRW 1,263,500–1,403,220 intact.",
